* 2 [[Cookbook:Quart|quarts]] [[Cookbook:Ketchup|ketchup]]\n* 1 ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] [[Cookbook:Maple Syrup|maple syrup]] (preferably a dark grade)\n* 1 cup apple [[Cookbook:Cider Vinegar|cider vinegar]]\n* ¼ cup [[Cookbook:Hickory BBQ Rub|Hickory BBQ Rub]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|Tbsp]] yellow [[Cookbook:Mustard|mustard]]\n* ½ cup [[Cookbook:Worcestershire Sauce|Worcestershire sauce]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Habanero|habanero]] chiles, stemmed\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Combine all ingredients in a large [[Cookbook:Saucepan|saucepan]] or pot.\n#Bring to a [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]] over high heat and cook until liquid has reduced by ⅓. \n#Remove chiles and discard.\n#Keep refrigerated in an airtight container for up to 3 weeks.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for barbecue sauce]]\n[[Category:Recipes using maple syrup]]\n[[Category:Boiled recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using tomato]]\n[[Category:Recipes using vinegar]]\n[[Category:Refrigerated recipes]]\n[[Category:United States recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using habanero chile]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ketchup]]\n[[Category:Recipes using yellow mustard]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Maple Barbecue Sauce","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 quarts ketchup","sourceText":"2 quarts ketchup","amountText":"2 quarts ketchup","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 ½ cups maple syrup (preferably a dark grade)","sourceText":"1 ½ cups maple syrup (preferably a dark grade)","amountText":"1 ½ cups maple syrup (preferably a dark grade)","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 cup apple cider vinegar","sourceText":"1 cup apple cider vinegar","amountText":"1 cup apple cider vinegar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"¼ cup Hickory BBQ Rub","sourceText":"¼ cup Hickory BBQ Rub","amountText":"¼ cup Hickory BBQ Rub","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"